.el .ds Aq '
.TH focusforge-cli-info 1  "info 0.1.0-rc.2" 
.SH NAME
focusforge\-cli\-info \- Print project, TIFF or RAW metadata for a file, or for every frame in a directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfocusforge\-cli info\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-v \fR]... [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPATH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print project, TIFF or RAW metadata for a file, or for every frame in a directory
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the JSON document instead of human\-readable text
.TP
\fB\-v\fR
Increase log detail (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Log errors only
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPATH\fR>
Path to a file or directory
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0\-rc.2
